#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:4
msgid "Physics Schemas"
msgstr "物理 Schema"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:6
msgid ""
"A robot model needs more than geometry to simulate. Its links need mass, its"
" shapes need collision properties, and its joints need physical constraints."
" USD stores these properties in **schemas**: named groups of attributes "
"attached to objects in the scene. An object in a USD scene is called a "
"**prim**; a robot link, collision mesh, or joint can each be a prim."
msgstr ""
"机器人模型要参与仿真，只有几何还不够：连杆需要质量，形状需要碰撞属性，关节需要物理约束。USD 通过 **Schema** "
"存储这些属性，即附加在场景对象上的具名属性组。USD 场景中的对象称为 **prim**；机器人连杆、碰撞网格或关节都可以是 prim。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:12
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab's schema configurations let you set these properties from Python "
"when an asset is spawned. Use them to tune an existing asset or give a new "
"shape its physical properties, without editing the source USD file by hand. "
"An imported asset may already contain everything you need; override only the"
" properties you want to change."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 的 Schema 配置允许在生成资产时通过 Python 设置这些属性。您可以调整已有资产，或为新形状赋予物理属性，无需手动编辑源 "
"USD 文件。导入的资产可能已经包含所需设置，只需覆盖要更改的属性。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:17
msgid ""
"These are asset settings. Choose the simulation backend and its scene-wide "
"solver settings separately through :doc:`backends_and_presets`."
msgstr "这些是资产级设置。仿真后端及其场景级求解器设置，应另行通过 :doc:`backends_and_presets` 选择。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:22
msgid "What is a fragment?"
msgstr "什么是片段？"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:24
msgid ""
"A **schema fragment** is a small Python configuration object that sets "
"properties from one USD schema or attribute namespace. For example, "
"``MassCfg(mass=0.5)`` sets a mass property, while "
"``UsdPhysicsCollisionCfg(collision_enabled=True)`` sets a collision "
"property."
msgstr ""
"**Schema 片段** 是一个小型 Python 配置对象，用于设置某个 USD Schema "
"或属性命名空间中的属性。例如，``MassCfg(mass=0.5)`` "
"设置质量，``UsdPhysicsCollisionCfg(collision_enabled=True)`` 设置碰撞属性。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:29
msgid ""
"It is called a fragment because it describes just one part of an asset's "
"physics configuration. Combine fragments to describe the properties you "
"need, then pass them to the appropriate spawner fields. A fragment is "
"configuration data, not a separate USD file or a piece of geometry."
msgstr ""
"之所以称为片段，是因为它只描述资产物理配置的一部分。将多个片段组合起来，再传入生成器的相应字段，即可定义所需属性。片段是配置数据，不是独立的 USD "
"文件或几何体。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:34
msgid "The distinction is:"
msgstr "三者的区别在于："

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:36
msgid ""
"The **schema** defines the available properties and how they are stored in "
"USD."
msgstr "**Schema** 定义可用属性及其在 USD 中的存储方式。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:37
msgid "The **fragment** supplies the values you want to set from Python."
msgstr "**片段** 提供希望通过 Python 设置的值。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:38
msgid ""
"The **spawner** applies those values to the asset's prims when it creates "
"the asset."
msgstr "**生成器** 在创建资产时，将这些值应用到资产的 prim 上。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:42
msgid "Give an object physical properties"
msgstr "为对象设置物理属性"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:44
msgid ""
"This configuration creates a small box with a mass of 0.5 kg and enabled "
"collisions:"
msgstr "以下配置创建一个质量为 0.5 kg、启用碰撞的小方块："

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:58
msgid ""
"Pass this configuration to an asset's ``spawn`` field, such as "
"``RigidObjectCfg(spawn=cuboid, ...)``. The spawner creates the geometry and "
"applies the schema configurations; the physics backend then reads the "
"resulting properties."
msgstr ""
"将此配置传给资产的 ``spawn`` 字段，例如 ``RigidObjectCfg(spawn=cuboid, ...)``。生成器创建几何并应用 "
"Schema 配置，随后物理后端读取生成的属性。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:62
msgid "Each spawner field controls a different part of the asset:"
msgstr "生成器的每个字段控制资产的不同部分："

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:68 source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:448
#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:561
msgid "Field"
msgstr "字段"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:69
msgid "What it controls"
msgstr "控制内容"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:70 source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:606
msgid "``rigid_props``"
msgstr "``rigid_props``"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:71
msgid "Rigid-body behavior, such as whether a body is kinematic."
msgstr "刚体行为，例如是否为运动学刚体。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:72 source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:612
msgid "``mesh_collision_props``"
msgstr "``mesh_collision_props``"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:73
msgid ""
"Mesh approximation and backend cooking settings for existing colliders."
msgstr "已有碰撞体的网格近似方式及后端预处理设置。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:74 source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:615
msgid "``mass_props``"
msgstr "``mass_props``"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:75
msgid "Mass or density for rigid bodies."
msgstr "刚体的质量或密度。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:76 source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:609
msgid "``collision_props``"
msgstr "``collision_props``"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:77
msgid "Collision behavior and contact settings."
msgstr "碰撞行为与接触设置。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:78 source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:618
msgid "``articulation_props``"
msgstr "``articulation_props``"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:79
msgid "Properties of a connected robot, such as its fixed root."
msgstr "关节系统的属性，例如根部固定设置。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:80 source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:621
msgid "``joint_drive_props``"
msgstr "``joint_drive_props``"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:81
msgid "Joint drive settings stored on the asset."
msgstr "保存在资产上的关节驱动设置。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:82
msgid "``physics_material``"
msgstr "``physics_material``"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:83
msgid "Surface properties such as friction and restitution."
msgstr "摩擦、恢复系数等表面属性。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:85
msgid ""
"For joints controlled by Isaac Lab actuators, also read :doc:`actuators`: "
"actuator configuration can override drive settings after spawning."
msgstr "若关节由 Isaac Lab 执行器控制，还需阅读 :doc:`actuators`：生成后，执行器配置可能覆盖驱动设置。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:88
msgid ""
"A field set to ``None`` leaves the existing attribute unchanged. An empty "
"fragment, such as ``UsdPhysicsRigidBodyCfg()``, still requests the "
"corresponding schema; it does not replace every attribute with a Python "
"default."
msgstr ""
"字段设为 ``None`` 时保留已有属性值。``UsdPhysicsRigidBodyCfg()`` 这样的空片段仍表示需要对应的 "
"Schema，但不会用 Python 默认值替换所有属性。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:96
msgid "Add backend-specific settings"
msgstr "添加后端专用设置"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:98
msgid ""
"A spawner field can accept a list of fragments for the same property family."
" Use a list to combine shared USD properties with settings for a particular "
"backend:"
msgstr "生成器字段可接受同一属性族的片段列表。通过列表，将通用 USD 属性与特定后端的设置组合起来："

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:114
msgid ""
"Here, ``UsdPhysicsCollisionCfg`` enables collisions and "
"``NewtonCollisionCfg`` sets a Newton contact margin of 1 mm. They describe "
"the same collision shape, so they belong together in ``collision_props``."
msgstr ""
"这里，``UsdPhysicsCollisionCfg`` 启用碰撞，``NewtonCollisionCfg`` 将 Newton 的接触裕量设为 1"
" mm。二者描述同一个碰撞形状，因此都放在 ``collision_props`` 中。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:118
msgid ""
"Import shared fragments from ``isaaclab.sim.schemas``, PhysX fragments from "
"``isaaclab_physx.sim.schemas``, and Newton or MuJoCo fragments from "
"``isaaclab_newton.sim.schemas``. Material fragments live in the "
"corresponding ``sim.spawners.materials`` modules."
msgstr ""
"通用片段从 ``isaaclab.sim.schemas`` 导入，PhysX 片段从 ``isaaclab_physx.sim.schemas`` "
"导入，Newton 或 MuJoCo 片段从 ``isaaclab_newton.sim.schemas`` 导入。材质片段位于各自的 "
"``sim.spawners.materials`` 模块中。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:123
msgid ""
"You can store settings for several backends on one asset. This does not "
"activate those backends or make their parameters interchangeable: a solver "
"must support a property for it to affect the simulation. For example, MuJoCo"
" gravity compensation settings apply to Newton's MuJoCo solver, not to "
"PhysX."
msgstr ""
"同一资产可以保存多个后端的设置，但这不会启用相应后端，也不意味着参数可以互换：属性只有在求解器支持时才会影响仿真。例如，MuJoCo "
"的重力补偿设置适用于 Newton 的 MuJoCo 求解器，不适用于 PhysX。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:130
msgid "Configure an existing robot"
msgstr "配置已有机器人"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:132
msgid ""
"``UsdFileCfg`` accepts the same property fields. Pass a fragment or list "
"directly to update existing matching bodies, collisions, or joints "
"throughout the imported asset. Use a dictionary when different parts need "
"different settings:"
msgstr ""
"``UsdFileCfg`` 接受相同的属性字段。直接传入片段或列表，可更新导入资产中所有匹配的刚体、碰撞体或关节；不同部分需要不同设置时，则使用字典："

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:161
msgid ""
"Dictionary keys are regular-expression suffixes appended to the spawn prim's"
" path. For example, if the robot is spawned at ``/World/Robot``, ``\"/.*\"``"
" searches beneath ``/World/Robot``. Rules apply in order, so a later rule "
"can override an earlier one. In this example, the hand subtree receives a "
"smaller PhysX depenetration limit."
msgstr ""
"字典键是附加在生成 prim 路径后的正则表达式后缀。例如，机器人生成在 ``/World/Robot`` 时，``\"/.*\"`` 会搜索 "
"``/World/Robot`` 下方的对象。规则按顺序应用，后面的规则可覆盖前面的规则。本例为手部子树设置了较小的 PhysX 穿透修正速度上限。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:170
msgid "Pattern"
msgstr "模式"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:171
msgid "Selection relative to the anchor"
msgstr "相对于锚点的选择范围"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:172
msgid "``\"\"``"
msgstr "``\"\"``"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:173
msgid "The anchor itself."
msgstr "仅锚点自身。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:174
msgid "``\"/[^/]+\"``"
msgstr "``\"/[^/]+\"``"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:175
msgid "Direct children only."
msgstr "仅直接子节点。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:176
msgid "``\"/.*\"``"
msgstr "``\"/.*\"``"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:177
msgid "All descendants, at any depth."
msgstr "所有层级的后代节点。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:178
msgid "``\"(/.*)?\"``"
msgstr "``\"(/.*)?\"``"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:179
msgid "The anchor and all descendants."
msgstr "锚点及其所有后代节点。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:181
msgid ""
"For USD, URDF, and MJCF imports, the anchor is the spawn prim. Shape and "
"mesh spawners use the geometry prim for collision and mesh-collision "
"properties, and the container prim for rigid-body and mass properties. "
"Deformable settings use the spawn prim for every spawner type."
msgstr ""
"对于 USD、URDF 和 MJCF 导入，锚点是生成 prim。形状和网格生成器以几何 prim 为碰撞及网格碰撞属性的锚点，以容器 prim "
"为刚体与质量属性的锚点。所有生成器的可变形体设置均以生成 prim 为锚点。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:186
msgid ""
"The search includes inactive and undefined prims as well as instance "
"proxies. Patterns select candidate prims; the property family then filters "
"them. For example, rigid-body settings apply to rigid bodies, and joint-"
"drive settings apply to revolute or prismatic joints. A broad pattern does "
"not normally turn every mesh into a body."
msgstr ""
"搜索范围包含未激活、未定义的 prim 和实例代理。模式先选择候选 "
"prim，再由属性族过滤。例如，刚体设置应用于刚体，关节驱动设置应用于旋转或移动关节。较宽泛的模式通常不会将每个网格都变为刚体。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:193
msgid "When a setting does not apply"
msgstr "设置未生效时"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:195
msgid ""
"First check that the selected backend supports the property and that the "
"pattern matches the intended prim. Matching uses the whole path: ``.*`` can "
"cross ``/`` boundaries, while ``[^/]+`` matches just one path segment."
msgstr ""
"先确认所选后端支持该属性，且模式匹配到预期的 prim。匹配针对完整路径：``.*`` 可跨越 ``/``，而 ``[^/]+`` 只匹配单个路径段。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:199
msgid ""
"Most fragment writers modify prims that already have the relevant USD API, "
"meaning the schema that identifies them as a body, collision shape, or other"
" physics object. For mass, articulation, and joint-drive settings, the "
"spawner flags ``mass_props_create_if_missing``, "
"``articulation_props_create_if_missing``, and "
"``joint_drive_props_create_if_missing`` can create missing APIs on matched "
"targets."
msgstr ""
"大多数片段写入器只修改已具有相应 USD API 的 prim，也就是已通过 Schema 标识为刚体、碰撞形状或其他物理对象的 "
"prim。对于质量、关节系统和关节驱动设置，生成器标志 "
"``mass_props_create_if_missing``、``articulation_props_create_if_missing`` 和 "
"``joint_drive_props_create_if_missing`` 可在匹配目标上创建缺失的 API。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:207
msgid ""
"Keep patterns narrow when enabling API creation. A broad mass pattern can "
"give each matching mesh its own mass, rather than setting one mass for the "
"body."
msgstr "启用 API 创建时，应尽量缩小模式范围。宽泛的质量模式可能为每个匹配网格分别赋予质量，而不是为整个刚体设置一个质量。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:210
msgid ""
"Shape and mesh spawners create the APIs needed by their new geometry. With a"
" bare fragment or list, file spawners search for existing schema carriers; "
"if none exist for the family, they apply it at the spawn prim, treating the "
"asset as a single body. Mesh-collision fragments are an exception: they only"
" modify existing colliders. Explicit dictionaries give you control over the "
"target selection."
msgstr ""
"形状和网格生成器会创建新几何所需的 API。对于不带字典的片段或列表，文件生成器会查找已具有相应 Schema "
"的对象；若该属性族找不到此类对象，则将其应用到生成 "
"prim，把资产视为单个刚体。网格碰撞片段是例外，它只修改已有碰撞体。使用显式字典可自行控制目标选择。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:216
msgid ""
"The writers warn when no valid targets are found or when a target is an "
"instance proxy that cannot be edited. An empty fragment list makes no "
"changes. Joint-drive patterns silently skip non-joint prims, since a subtree"
" can contain both joints and meshes."
msgstr ""
"找不到有效目标，或目标是不可编辑的实例代理时，写入器会发出警告。空片段列表不会修改任何内容。关节驱动模式会静默跳过非关节 "
"prim，因为同一子树中可能同时包含关节和网格。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:225
msgid "Gravity compensation with MuJoCo"
msgstr "MuJoCo 重力补偿"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:227
msgid ""
"Set body-level ``gravcomp`` to compute gravity compensation. Set joint-level"
" ``actuatorgravcomp`` to route that force through the actuator channel, "
"where actuator force limits apply; otherwise it goes through the passive-"
"force channel."
msgstr ""
"设置刚体级 ``gravcomp`` 可计算重力补偿；设置关节级 ``actuatorgravcomp`` "
"可让补偿力通过执行器通道施加，并受执行器力限制约束，否则补偿力通过被动力通道施加。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:243
msgid ""
"``gravcomp=1.0`` provides full compensation. The joint fragment also enables"
" full compensation on its child body if that body's value is unset or zero; "
"an existing nonzero value is kept. To disable compensation, turn off "
"``actuatorgravcomp`` as well as setting the body's ``gravcomp`` to zero."
msgstr ""
"``gravcomp=1.0`` "
"表示完全补偿。如果子刚体的补偿值未设置或为零，关节片段也会为其启用完全补偿；已有的非零值则保留。若要禁用补偿，除了将刚体的 ``gravcomp`` "
"设为零，还要关闭 ``actuatorgravcomp``。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:248
msgid ""
"The older ``MujocoJointDrivePropertiesCfg`` also auto-enables body "
"compensation when requested, unless an explicit body ``gravcomp`` value is "
"supplied. Prefer the fragment example above for new configurations."
msgstr ""
"旧的 ``MujocoJointDrivePropertiesCfg`` 也会在请求时自动启用刚体补偿，除非已显式提供刚体的 ``gravcomp`` "
"值。新配置应优先使用上面的片段示例。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:254
msgid "Mesh collision settings"
msgstr "网格碰撞设置"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:256
msgid ""
"Mesh-collision fragments use the same anchor as collision fragments and only"
" modify existing colliders; they never create colliders. For example, to "
"cook every collider of a USD asset as a convex hull with a PhysX vertex "
"limit:"
msgstr ""
"网格碰撞片段与碰撞片段使用相同的锚点，只修改已有碰撞体，不创建碰撞体。例如，将 USD 资产的所有碰撞体预处理为凸包，并设置 PhysX 顶点数上限："

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:277
msgid "Deformable bodies"
msgstr "可变形物体"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:279
msgid ""
"Choose ``volume_deformable_props`` for a solid deformable or "
"``surface_deformable_props`` for a cloth-like surface. Set only one of these"
" fields on a spawner. Both accept ``OmniPhysicsDeformableBodyCfg`` for "
"shared properties such as mass and kinematic behavior; PhysX also provides "
"tuning fragments."
msgstr ""
"实体可变形体使用 ``volume_deformable_props``，布料一类的表面使用 "
"``surface_deformable_props``。同一生成器只能设置其中一个字段。二者均接受 "
"``OmniPhysicsDeformableBodyCfg``，用于配置质量、运动学行为等通用属性；PhysX 还提供专用的调优片段。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:284
msgid ""
"Unlike most rigid-body writers, deformable writers create the deformable "
"setup if it is missing. Set deformable mass with "
"``OmniPhysicsDeformableBodyCfg.mass``; ``UsdPhysics.MassAPI`` does not "
"control it."
msgstr ""
"与大多数刚体写入器不同，可变形体写入器会在缺少相应设置时创建它。可变形体质量通过 "
"``OmniPhysicsDeformableBodyCfg.mass`` 设置，不受 ``UsdPhysics.MassAPI`` 控制。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:288
msgid ""
"This example creates a volume deformable with PhysX tuning, a collision "
"offset on its simulation mesh, and material settings for both PhysX and "
"Newton:"
msgstr "本例创建一个体积可变形体，包含 PhysX 调优设置、仿真网格上的碰撞偏移，以及 PhysX 和 Newton 的材质设置："

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:311
msgid ""
"The simulation mesh is a child named ``sim_mesh`` by default. Target it "
"through ``collision_props`` to set collision offsets. Deformable and "
"simulation-mesh collision patterns are relative to the spawn prim."
msgstr ""
"仿真网格默认是名为 ``sim_mesh`` 的子节点。可通过 ``collision_props`` "
"选中它并设置碰撞偏移。可变形体和仿真网格碰撞模式均相对于生成 prim。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:315
msgid ""
"``physics_material`` accepts deformable material fragments and lists that "
"mix rigid and deformable material settings. Each fragment applies its own "
"material schema; a material used only by deformables does not need the "
"rigid-body material API."
msgstr ""
"``physics_material`` 接受可变形体材质片段，也接受混合刚体与可变形体材质设置的列表。每个片段应用自身的材质 "
"Schema；只供可变形体使用的材质无需刚体材质 API。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:321
msgid "Using the property configuration classes"
msgstr "使用属性配置类"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:323
msgid ""
"You will also see classes such as ``RigidBodyBaseCfg`` and "
"``PhysxRigidBodyPropertiesCfg`` in existing tasks. These combine a property "
"group's shared and backend-specific fields in one object. These "
"compatibility classes are deprecated and scheduled for removal in 3.2. "
"Existing configurations still work in the same spawner fields, but use "
"fragments for new code. Pass a compatibility object directly, rather than "
"placing it in a fragment list."
msgstr ""
"在现有任务中，您还会看到 ``RigidBodyBaseCfg`` 和 ``PhysxRigidBodyPropertiesCfg`` "
"等类，它们将某一属性组的通用字段和后端专用字段合并在同一对象中。这些兼容类已弃用，计划在 3.2 "
"中移除。已有配置仍可传入相同的生成器字段，但新代码应使用片段。兼容对象应直接传入，不要放进片段列表。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:331
msgid ""
"Base classes in ``isaaclab.sim.schemas`` contain shared fields and do not "
"import a backend package."
msgstr "``isaaclab.sim.schemas`` 中的基类包含通用字段，不导入任何后端包。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:333
