#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:435
msgid ""
"Most shared fields write to ``physics:*`` (the standard ``UsdPhysics.*API`` "
"namespace), but a small set of \"exception\" fields are declared on the base"
" for backend-portability yet route to a non-``physics:*`` namespace because "
"that is the only USD path honored today (e.g., ``disable_gravity`` writes "
"``physxRigidBody:disableGravity`` because both PhysX and Newton's importer "
"consume the PhysX attribute). The \"USD attribute\" column below is the "
"actual emitted attribute, not the namespace family."
msgstr ""
"大部分通用字段写入 ``physics:*`` （标准 ``UsdPhysics.*API`` "
"命名空间），但有少量例外：为了跨后端使用而在基类上声明，却写入非 ``physics:*`` 命名空间，因为目前只有该 USD "
"路径会被读取。例如，``disable_gravity`` 写入 ``physxRigidBody:disableGravity``，因为 PhysX "
"和 Newton 导入器都读取此 PhysX 属性。下方“USD 属性”列列出实际写入的属性，而非命名空间类别。"

