#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:572
msgid ""
"The two MuJoCo rows differ in their USD applied-schema requirement: "
"``mjc:actuatorgravcomp`` is part of the registered ``MjcJointAPI`` applied "
"schema (so the writer calls ``prim.AddAppliedSchema(\"MjcJointAPI\")`` when "
"the field is non-None). ``mjc:gravcomp`` has no registered Mjc applied "
"schema for body-level gravity compensation, so the writer authors it as a "
"raw USD attribute. Newton's MuJoCo solver consumes both via the same "
"resolver path; the schema-application difference is purely a USD-side "
"detail."
msgstr ""
"这两个 MuJoCo 条目对 USD 应用模式的要求不同： ``mjc:actuatorgravcomp`` 属于已注册的 "
"``MjcJointAPI`` 应用模式，因此字段不是 None 时，写入器会调用 "
"``prim.AddAppliedSchema(\"MjcJointAPI\")`` 。刚体级重力补偿的 ``mjc:gravcomp`` 没有已注册的"
" Mjc 应用模式，因此写入器将其写为原始 USD 属性。Newton 的 MuJoCo 求解器通过同一解析路径读取两者；应用模式的区别仅是 USD "
"端的细节。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:0
msgid "Fragment writers and target families"
msgstr "片段写入器与目标族"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:583
msgid ""
"Every fragment subclasses :class:`~isaaclab.sim.schemas.SchemaFragment` and "
"declares which USD namespace its fields write to and which applied schema, "
"if any, it owns. A fragment's "
":attr:`~isaaclab.sim.schemas.SchemaFragment.func` names the callable that "
"applies it to a prim; the default applier "
"(:func:`~isaaclab.sim.schemas.apply_namespaced`) writes each non-``None`` "
"field as ``<namespace>:<camelCase(field)>`` and leaves ``None`` fields "
"untouched (partial update). Irregular APIs override ``func`` — for example "
":class:`~isaaclab.sim.schemas.UsdPhysicsDriveCfg` dispatches through "
":func:`~isaaclab.sim.schemas.apply_drive` to handle the multi-instance "
"``UsdPhysics.DriveAPI``."
msgstr ""
"各片段继承 :class:`~isaaclab.sim.schemas.SchemaFragment` ，声明字段写入的 USD "
"命名空间，以及自己负责的应用模式（如果有）。片段的 :attr:`~isaaclab.sim.schemas.SchemaFragment.func` "
"指定将其应用到 prim 的可调用对象。默认应用函数（ :func:`~isaaclab.sim.schemas.apply_namespaced` "
"）将各非 ``None`` 字段写为 ``<namespace>:<camelCase(field)>`` ，不修改 ``None`` "
"字段（部分更新）。特殊 API 会覆盖 ``func`` ，例如 "
":class:`~isaaclab.sim.schemas.UsdPhysicsDriveCfg` 通过 "
":func:`~isaaclab.sim.schemas.apply_drive` 分发，处理多实例 ``UsdPhysics.DriveAPI`` 。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:594
msgid ""
"Fragments are grouped into *families*, one per spawner slot. Most families "
"have a writer that resolves target prims from an expression and dispatches "
"every fragment via its ``func``. Backend fragments carry backend-specific "
"appliers, so the core package never imports a backend:"
msgstr ""
"片段按 *属性族* 分组，每个族对应一个生成器字段。大多数族都有写入器，根据表达式解析目标 prim，再通过各片段的 ``func`` "
"分发。后端片段自带后端专用的应用函数，因此核心包无需导入后端："

